get.description:
Get a bot by URL identifier (slug).

Restricted bots are 404-invisible to actors without use access;
org owners and platform admins see them with ``can_use=false``.

PackLeavePendingChoice.description:
Bind nothing now, even when exactly one server would fit (J10 = C2).

Kept on the install, so the setups recorded after it never auto-bind it either;
only an explicit bind does. An MCP catalogue entry connection only.

ScheduleNotifyMode.description:
When a ``notify_humans`` routing action actually notifies.

``ON_CHANGE`` only when the outcome class flips (``ok`` <-> ``not_ok``);
``EVERY_RUN`` on every matching outcome.

ConversationSecurityRedactionEvent.description:
Best-effort live UX event for a user-message ingress redaction.

Reload rendering uses the persisted ``TextContent.metadata`` on the message;
this event is just the immediate Centrifugo path.
